      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Is it possible that the course used for the Model Replay in this PR includes a curve toward the end?\nIf so, it looks very consistent to me: desiredAcceleration trends toward deceleration while desiredCurvature demand increases, which reads like a very stable model behavior.\n\nIs anyone planning to share a driving report with this model? I’m really looking forward to hearing how it performs in real-world driving.\nhttps://github.com/commaai/openpilot/pull/36798",
